{
  "kanda": "kishkindha",
  "sarga": 34,
  "title": "Lakshmana upbraids Sugreeva",
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.valmikiramayan.net/utf8/kish/sarga34/kishkindhasans34.htm",
  "romanUrl": "https://www.valmikiramayan.net/utf8/kish/sarga34/kishkindhaitrans34.htm",
  "translator": "Desiraju Hanumanta Rao",
  "introduction": [
    "Lakshmana enters the interior of Sugreeva's chamber. Sugreeva finding him there is alarmed and approaches him in all his humbleness. Then Lakshmana chastens Sugreeva with harsh words and cautions him to face the wrath of the arrows of Rama."
  ],
  "closing": [
    "इति वाल्मीकि रामायणे आदि काव्ये किष्किन्ध काण्डे चतुर् त्रिंशः सर्गः",
    "Thus, this is the 34th chapter in Kishkindha Kanda of Valmiki Ramayana, the First Epic poem of India."
  ],
  "verses": [
